-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The route table built into the binary (internal/pme/table/default.json) holds
model facts from OpenRouter's public model listing (prices, modalities, context
limits, endpoints) and the p0ssess engine service's answers for each use case.
It carries no benchmark data.

